/usr/lib: Stands for "User System Libraries".
Contains shared libraries for user programs.

Holds architecture-independent data files.

Stores static libraries and module files.

dpkg/apt: Debian package management tools.

systemd: System and service manager configs.

NetworkManager: Network connection profiles.

ssl/certs: Security certificates and keys.

udev: Device manager rules.

pam.d: Pluggable Authentication Modules.

ssh/openssh: Secure shell server settings.

cron.d: Scheduled task definitions.

default: Application default configurations.